# SECTION: GALLERY OF KINGS
# Description: The horizontal band of 28 statues of biblical kings above the
# portals. Each king stands in a Gothic niche beneath an ornate canopy. This
# gallery spans the full width of the facade, creating a rhythmic horizontal
# element that ties the three portals together.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

