# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SECTION: ATMOSPHERIC PERSPECTIVE & SKY
# Description: Subtle texture in the background suggesting atmosphere and
# depth. Lighter marks above the cathedral create sense of open sky.
# Dashes are scattered across the upper portion of the canvas, growing
# sparser toward the zenith to suggest infinite depth. Flow field from
# horizontal strokes creates gentle cloud-like drift in the marks.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Invisible guide strokes to establish horizontal flow for sky dashes
# These create the gentle drift direction for atmospheric marks
